OL,3,ANew thunderstorm warnings for parts of
OL,4,AUK as rain set to continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FMet Office yellow warnings for
OL,7,Fthunderstorms will remain in force for
OL,8,Fmost of Thursday as downpours and
OL,9,Fthunderstorms move northwards across
OL,10,Fthe UK.
OL,12,FSouthern England was first to see the
OL,13,Frain overnight, with a yellow warning
OL,14,Fcontinuing until 08:00 BST in the
OL,15,Fsouth-east.
OL,17,FA wider warning area covers all of
OL,18,FWales and large swathes of England and
OL,19,Flasts until 22:00, with downpours
OL,20,Fbringing the risk of localised flash
OL,21,Fflooding and travel disruption.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
